WEBVTT

1
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:28,780
You were dug out of a cesspool, right? Don't talk, sister.

2
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:31,300
Are we thirsty and have water?

3
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,700
Give me some water first

4
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,950
I will pass a page in the broken knife tonight

5
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:40,990
Go out again tomorrow

6
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:43,440
Okay, okay, no problem

7
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,560
I listen to my eldest sister
